| Time (local) | Activity |
|--------------|----------|
| **Nov 8 – 12:00 pm** | Pick up rental car (Enterprise/Hertz/Avis) right at The Westin. |
| **Nov 8 – 3:00 pm** | Check‑in to The Westin (rooms ready). |
| **Nov 8 – Evening** | Party in Downtown Seattle (bars, restaurants, or private venue – all within walking distance). |
| **Nov 9 – 12:00 pm** | Check‑out (store luggage with hotel bell desk if you need extra time). |
| **Nov 9 – 2:00 pm** | Return rental car at the same spot (no extra mileage cost). |
| **Nov 9 – After** | Continue exploring Seattle or head to the airport. |

